<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Granadero family face review</title><style>body{font:16px/1.4 system-ui;background:#202725;color:#eee;margin:24px}a{color:#dfc993}h1{margin:0}.meta{color:#bbc7bf;max-width:1100px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}article{background:#303832;padding:12px}h2{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 8px}img{width:100%;display:block}p{font-size:14px}details{margin:20px 0}@media(max-width:1100px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}</style><h1>Current face review</h1><p class="meta">Eight actual LOD0 models · same light skin palette · same isometric camera scale and lighting · idle at 0 seconds. Granadero alone uses the new registered albedo. This gallery is a review, not a claim that all eight faces have improved.</p><p><a href="faces-contact-sheet.png">Labelled contact sheet</a> · <a href="review.json">Source hashes and review details</a></p><div class="grid"><article><h2>Granadero</h2><a href="generated/granadero/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png"><img src="generated/granadero/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png" alt="Granadero face"></a><p>Visible pores, stubble and lip colour add detail. The eyebrow pigment still has a broad, soft outer tail. This is an incremental skin gain, not completed face realism.</p><a href="generated/granadero/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.png">Full isometric frame</a></article><article><h2>Realista</h2><a href="native/royalist/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png"><img src="native/royalist/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png" alt="Realista face"></a><p>The cheeks, brow and lips remain smooth. The face shape matches the other native male characters; the uniform supplies most of the identity.</p><a href="native/royalist/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.png">Full isometric frame</a></article><article><h2>Trabajador</h2><a href="native/worker/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png"><img src="native/worker/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png" alt="Trabajador face"></a><p>The same smooth male face remains. Hair has regular broad grooves and a sharp, continuous forehead edge, which reads as a moulded cap.</p><a href="native/worker/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.png">Full isometric frame</a></article><article><h2>Cirujano</h2><a href="native/surgeon/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png"><img src="native/surgeon/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png" alt="Cirujano face"></a><p>The face and hair are visually almost identical to the worker at this angle. The cap-like hair and low skin variation remain.</p><a href="native/surgeon/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.png">Full isometric frame</a></article><article><h2>Gaucho</h2><a href="native/gaucho/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png"><img src="native/gaucho/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png" alt="Gaucho face"></a><p>The hat changes the silhouette, but the visible nose, jaw, brows and skin are the same native male design. Fine face detail is weak.</p><a href="native/gaucho/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.png">Full isometric frame</a></article><article><h2>Fraile</h2><a href="native/friar/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png"><img src="native/friar/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png" alt="Fraile face"></a><p>The tonsure has a saw-tooth polygon boundary and thick hair ring. The bald scalp is more visibly mottled than the smooth face, so the two surfaces do not read as one skin treatment.</p><a href="native/friar/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.png">Full isometric frame</a></article><article><h2>Exploradora</h2><a href="native/woman-scout/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png"><img src="native/woman-scout/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png" alt="Exploradora face"></a><p>The female face is very smooth. Hair has thick, regular ridges, a hard temple edge and a rope-like braid. The face lacks local skin and eyebrow variation.</p><a href="native/woman-scout/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.png">Full isometric frame</a></article><article><h2>Mujer con rebozo</h2><a href="native/woman-shawl/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png"><img src="native/woman-shawl/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.face.png" alt="Mujer con rebozo face"></a><p>The face repeats the scout&#x27;s native female shape and pigment. Hair still reads as a smooth cap; the different bun and clothing supply the identity.</p><a href="native/woman-shawl/stand.idle.unarmed.sample-1.png">Full isometric frame</a></article></div><p class="meta">Primary remaining issues: smooth native skin, repeated facial identity, and cap-like hair. The friar tonsure has a visibly jagged boundary. Granadero still has a wide, soft eyebrow tail. No source or model assets were changed.</p>